<title>UK: HORSE RACING-EIGHT RUNNERS CONFIRMED FOR KING GEORGE.</title>
<headline>HORSE RACING-EIGHT RUNNERS CONFIRMED FOR KING GEORGE.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Runners and riders for the King</p>
<p>George VI and Queen Elizabeth Diamond Stakes, a group one race</p>
<p>for three-year-olds and upwards, to be run over one and a half</p>
<p>miles (2.4 km) on Saturday (tabulate under recent form, horse,</p>
<p>jockey, latest betting:</p>
<p> 3-11  Helissio	    Cash Asmussen	  6-4</p>
<p> 321   Pilsudski	   Michael Kinane	11-2</p>
<p> 1-21  Predappio	   Gary Stevens	   8-1</p>
<p> 4-11  Shantou	     Gary Hind	     14-1</p>
<p> 1-11  Singspiel	   Frankie Dettori	2-1</p>
<p> 3-54  Strategic Choice  Ray Cochrane	  50-1</p>
<p> 43-2  Swain		 John Reid	     12-1</p>
<p> 141   Kingfisher Mill   Pat Eddery	    14-1</p>
<p>Official off time: 1450 GMT</p>
</text>
